              <li><a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/House_Rent_Allowance" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-link hover:underline dark:text-link">Wikipedia: House Rent Allowance</a> — Overview of HRA and its tax treatment in India.</li>
